      "commit": "5571e65f85 fix(linux): separate startup and forwarded deep links",
      "rootCause": "main.tsx and App.tsx concurrently drained the same one-shot initialDeepLinkRoute command. App could consume the initial provider route before main, after which main observed null and overwrote the destination with onboarding.",
